    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Afterwards, a stranger comes up to Arkady, asks if he's the mayor who broke his finger, and says he has a business proposal; and Marina phones the agents to say she has changed her mind and agrees. That's the end of the second episode, with the song about how much money it takes to be happy; well done! See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Спокойной ночи!",
      "gap": 0.3
